# Comma-separated extra hostnames allowed as <iframe> sources in recipe content. Extends the built-in list of trusted video providers (YouTube, Vimeo). Subdomains are included automatically. Only https sources are permitted. Adding hosts here opts into rendering embeds from those origins to all viewe…
